### Add binaries for testing ###
!go/build/
# The dcm4che jars are fetched into java/target/test-jars by java/pom.xml instead of being
# checked in -- dcm4che is MPL/GPL/LGPL, and a copy here would be redistribution. This guards
# against one being added back by hand.
java/src/test/resources/test-jars/dcm4che-*.jar

